<title>TAIWAN: Formosa Jan-Sept net down 5.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Formosa Jan-Sept net down 5.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-September 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover			    26,754 vs 27,514</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     5,654 vs  6,007</p>
<p>    Net profit			   4,952 vs  5,262</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (single T$)  2.32 vs   2.47</p>
<p>NOTE - Formosa Plastics Corp is one of the world's largest makers of polyvinyl chloride, or PVC.</p>
<p>The company attributed the fall in both sales and profits to price declines for PVC and other petrochemical products in the first nine months of 1996 compared to the 1995 period.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
